  <prompt>Remove the tenant-container-resolver diagnostic and everything that exists only to serve it; make "own container" have one definition.</prompt>

  <role>SPAARKE platform developer (BFF Minimal API, L2 control plane, ArchTests).</role>

  <goal>
    After T227d the BFF's one definition of "this stamp's container" is SpeContainerOwnershipGuard (configured stamp
    containers + the spaarkeCustomerId marker). The older diagnostic — ITenantContainerResolver /
    OptionsTenantContainerResolver / GET /api/diagnostics/tenant-container-resolver — has no consumer: L2's
    SpeContainerResolverInvariantProbe is retained on disk UNREGISTERED (E2EAcceptanceModule), and H13's I4 has read the
    deployed app settings since T227c. The resolver also reads SharePointEmbedded:StagingContainerId, which nothing
    writes. Remove the resolver, its endpoint and registration, the unregistered L2 probe and their tests; remove the
    StagingContainerId option and its reads (ChatDocumentEndpoints / ChatWordExportEndpoints / pre-fill services fall
    back to EmailProcessing:DefaultContainerId already); amend spec FR-31, the project CLAUDE.md MUST row, design §4D I4
    and the I4 ArchTest messages to name SpeContainerOwnershipGuard; lower the ADR010_DITests ceiling by one.
  </goal>

  <context>
    <background>
      Needed→build, else remove (owner feedback): the resolver is not needed, so it goes. unified-access-control-r2 task
      081 scoped the diagnostic route's authorization — check projects/INDEX.md for that project's state and say in the
      notes that the route is removed (a route that no longer exists needs no scoping). RouteAuthorizationGuardTests and
      SpeWriteSinkContainerProvenanceGuardTests name the route / StagingContainerId: update their lists, do not weaken
      their rules.
    </background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file>src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Endpoints/Diagnostics/{ITenantContainerResolver,OptionsTenantContainerResolver,TenantContainerResolverEndpoint,DiagnosticsModule}.cs</file>
      <file>src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Configuration/SharePointEmbeddedOptions.cs (StagingContainerId)</file>
      <file>src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/Ai/{ChatDocumentEndpoints,ChatWordExportEndpoints}.cs; Services/Workspace/{MatterPreFillService,ProjectPreFillService}.cs</file>
      <file>src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane.Core/Handlers/E2EAcceptance/SpeContainerResolverInvariantProbe.cs (+ its tests, E2EAcceptanceModule comment, H13RejectionCodes)</file>
      <file>tests/Spaarke.ArchTests/{ADR010_DITests,RouteAuthorizationGuardTests,SpeWriteSinkContainerProvenanceGuardTests}.cs; TenantIsolation/I4_SpeContainerIdLiteralTests.cs</file>
      <file>projects/customer-provisioning-orchestration-r1/{spec.md FR-31, CLAUDE.md MUST row, design.md §4D I4}</file>
    </relevant-files>
  </context>

